      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "4. It is contended by learned counsel for the petitioners that the respondent No.3 executed the sale deeds of the plots in favour of petitioner No.1 on 19.03.2021 and sale deed of the house on 22.09.2021, and thereafter, with the help of then SHO, P.S. Kotwali Gangnahar Shr. Govind Kumar,\nsucceeded to got execute the sale deed of the aforesaid plot on 12.03.2024 in favour of her husband,\nwithout any sale consideration and grabbed the all sale consideration of aforesaid plots and filed an application before S.P. Rural, Roorkee on 06.07.2024, in which the police after investigation,\nsubmitted its report on 18.07.2024, wherein, it has been mentioned that the respondent No.3 is a greedy lady and filed the application of the basis of false allegations against the petitioners.",
